Ten seconds of what a SIP caller heard through a station (1.2.0 with its trunk made by hand, the real-kit tries of 2026-11-21): the shipped Alba recording of the phone words, through LiveKit's SIP service and G.711. The Alba corpus's own condition applies, as for assets/phone/phone-words-alba.opus: see NOTICES.md.
